35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is just plasterboard. I can hear everything from my desk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We paid 68,000 yen last year for outside rooms. That is a lot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,Three keyboards have crumbs. The bins are full every day.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The only talk is by the printer. The new people are still isolated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Eleven callouts for equipment. The empty store room had zero.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if we pay outside, we are paying for silence we lack.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the invoices prove we are already spending money on this.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, the tally shows the two near the door use it most.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, usage is one thing, but the awkwardness is the other.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the callouts show the equipment causes problems, not the people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we make it a kitchen, the crumbs will get worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,A meeting space might stop the outside hiring costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"A quiet room would stop the noise, but who cleans the crumbs?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,A meeting space forces interaction. A quiet room isolates us more.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A kitchen adds maintenance. A meeting space adds booking friction.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,I prefer the meeting space. It solves the noise by controlling it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. The quotes for the screen are cheaper than the invoices.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am torn. The crumbs are a real issue for a kitchen.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I vote for the meeting space. We need to talk, not just eat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The meeting space seems the most efficient use of the hours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
